<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff" />
    <title>녹음 스파이크</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href={~p"/assets/css/app.css"} />
    <style>
      body { font-family: var(--font-sans); background: #f7f8fa; margin: 0; padding: 16px; }
      .wrap { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; }
      h1 { font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 4px; color: var(--text-content); }
      .sub { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 16px; }
      .panel { background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:16px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:12px; }
      .panel h2 { font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:var(--muted); margin:0 0 10px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.04em; }
      #env div { font-size:12px; font-family:var(--font-mono); color:var(--text); line-height:1.7; word-break:break-all; }
      #env .warn { color:#9a3412; background:#fff7ed; padding:8px; border-radius:10px; margin-top:8px; font-family:var(--font-sans); }
      .timer { font-size:56px; font-weight:300; text-align:center; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; color:var(--text-content); letter-spacing:.02em; }
      .state { text-align:center; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:8px; }
      .state[data-state="recording"] { color: var(--danger); }
      .state[data-state="paused"] { color: var(--warning); }
      #wave { width:100%; height:140px; border-radius:16px; background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(240,68,82,.08), rgba(255,120,140,.08)); display:block; }
      .controls { display:flex; gap:12px; justify-content:center; align-items:center; margin-top:16px; }
      .btn-rec { width:72px; height:72px; border:0; border-radius:50%; background:var(--danger); color:#fff; font-size:30px; cursor:pointer; box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(240,68,82,.3); }
      .btn-rec:active { transform:scale(.94); }
      .btn-sec { min-height:48px; padding:0 20px; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.12); border-radius:16px; background:#fff; font-size:15px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer; }
      .opt { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); justify-content:center; margin-top:12px; }
      #log { max-height:280px; overflow-y:auto; font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:11px; line-height:1.7; }
      .log-row { padding:2px 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.03); word-break:break-all; }
      .log-row--warn { color:#9a3412; }
      .log-row--error { color:#991b1b; font-weight:700; }
      .log-row--ok { color:#166534; }
      .result-card { font-size:13px; }
      .result-row { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:5px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
      .result-row span { color:var(--muted); }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>녹음 스파이크</h1>
      <p class="sub">
        모바일 백그라운드 녹음 검증용. 녹음을 시작한 뒤 <b>화면을 끄거나</b>
        <b>다른 앱으로 전환</b>하고 몇 분 뒤 돌아와 로그를 확인하세요.
      </p>

      <div class="panel">
        <h2>환경</h2>
        <div id="env"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel">
        <div class="state" id="state" data-state="idle">idle</div>
        <div class="timer" id="timer">00:00</div>
        <canvas id="wave"></canvas>

        <div class="controls">
          <button class="btn-sec" id="pause" hidden>일시정지</button>
          <button class="btn-rec" id="record">●</button>
          <button class="btn-sec" id="stop" hidden>정지</button>
        </div>

        <label class="opt">
          <input type="checkbox" id="wakelock" checked /> 화면 꺼짐 방지 (WakeLock)
        </label>
      </div>

      <div class="panel" id="result-panel">
        <h2>결과</h2>
        <div id="result"><span class="sub">아직 녹음이 없습니다.</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel">
        <h2>로그 (최신순)</h2>
        <div id="log"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <script src={~p"/assets/js/spike-recorder.js"}>
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
